WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.390
No doubt you've seen
the chaos in the streets.

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:19.769
We must make an example

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:20.937
or France will fall.

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:27.569
What would you do if this assignment
of defense was transferred to you?

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.870
I promise you brilliant successes.

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:50.216
What is this costume you have on?

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:51.342
This is my uniform.

00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:57.140
I led the French victory at Toulon.

00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:02.312
What is your name?
 

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:03.480
Napoleon.

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:05.857
Has the course of my life just changed...

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:07.150
Napoleon?

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:11.780
I am destined for greatness.

00:01:13.531 --> 00:01:15.867
But those in power only see me as a sword.

00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:19.954
I suggest you take the throne as king.

00:01:26.711 --> 00:01:27.629
Shall we vote?

00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:30.924
Long live the emperor! 

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:33.176
Long live the emperor!

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:39.015
This vermin has held the world hostage...

00:01:39.974 --> 00:01:43.520
with his egotism and his lack
of simple good manners.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.277
You think you're great.

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:56.533
You're just a tiny little brute

00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:58.660
that is nothing without me.

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:03.248
All of Europe is uniting forces against me.

00:02:03.706 --> 00:02:05.750
What's the outcome of this
if you don't succeed?

00:02:08.711 --> 00:02:10.588
Your majesty, we are discovered.

00:02:10.922 --> 00:02:11.464
Good.

00:02:13.174 --> 00:02:14.050
Ice!

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:15.009
It's a trap!

00:02:16.344 --> 00:02:18.429
I'm the first to admit
when I make a mistake...

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.019
I simply never do.

